<title>USA: Owens-Illinois sells $600 mln in 2-part deal.</title>
<headline>Owens-Illinois sells $600 mln in 2-part deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two-tranche debt issue from Owens-Illinois Inc was priced on Tuesday, via Morgan Stanley &amp; Co Inc, market sources said.</p>
<p>Both tranches were increased to $300 million in size from an original size of $250 million, sources added.</p>
<p>Owens-Illinois makes glass and containers.</p>
<p>BORROWER OWENS-ILLINOIS INC</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 7.85 PCT   MATURITY 5/15/2004</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.878  FIRST PAY DATE 11/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BA1   YIELD 7.873 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB-PLUS   SPREAD 125 BP     CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 8.10 PCT   MATURITY 5/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.865  FIRST PAY DATE 11/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BA1   YIELD 8.120 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB-PLUS   SPREAD 145 BP     CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
</text>
